CVE-2026-34260 is an authenticated SQL injection in S/4HANA's Enterprise Search for ABAP that can read data and affect availability but not integrity, not a pre-authentication code execution flaw, and CVE-2026-34263 in Commerce Cloud is unauthenticated but needs user interaction under SAP's vector. HotNews Note 3747787 for the SAP CAP npm compromise dates from 2026-04-30, and no cited source ties S/4HANA or Commerce Cloud to Swiss federal programmes.
